---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Deslopify Studio"
  description="Our philosophy, leadership, and operational principles for eliminating software slop and building investor-grade AI applications."
>
  <div class="subpage-container">
    <div class="page-hero">
      <span class="page-badge">Our Story & Methodology</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">
        Craft Over Slop.<br>
        <span class="gradient-text">Determinism Over Demos.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        Deslopify Studio was founded with a singular conviction: the world is drowning in generic AI boilerplate and fragile demos. We engineer the antidote.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Narrative -->
    <div style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto 70px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--card-gray); border-radius: 24px; padding: 48px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--jakarta); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink-heading); margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Why We Started Deslopify
      </h2>
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 20px;">
        In 2024, AI tools made it trivially easy to generate prototype code and generic Figma screens. But within months, a new crisis emerged: <strong>software slop</strong>. Companies were shipping unresponsive user interfaces, brittle multi-step prompt chains, and chatbots that hallucinated pricing or crashed on mobile networks.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Founders were left with messy proofs-of-concept that investors rejected and enterprise customers refused to adopt. Traditional design agencies had no engineering chops to fix backend latency, while standard dev shops built ugly, uninspired portals with zero taste.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--gray);">
        Deslopify unites world-class product design with senior systems engineering. We tear down legacy code, replace float columns with modern CSS Grid, implement deterministic LLM pipelines, and ship real coded prototypes directly to your phone.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Operational Principles -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 80px;">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <span class="tag">Operational Principles</span>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--jakarta); font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink-heading); margin-top: 12px;">
          The Rules We Live By
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-num">01</div>
          <h3 class="value-title">Zero Static Dead-Ends</h3>
          <p class="value-desc">We never hand off static PDFs or unexecutable design files. Every screen is verified with live interactive prototypes and production-ready code.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-num">02</div>
          <h3 class="value-title">Deterministic AI First</h3>
          <p class="value-desc">No raw model calls ever touch your database or UI directly. We enforce strict schema validation, semantic caching, and deterministic fallbacks.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-num">03</div>
          <h3 class="value-title">One Architect + AI Swarms</h3>
          <p class="value-desc">Zero bureaucratic account managers or endless discovery meetings. You collaborate directly with principal engineers augmented by autonomous agent swarms.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-num">04</div>
          <h3 class="value-title">Sub-500ms Latency SLA</h3>
          <p class="value-desc">Speed is craft. We optimize every token stream, WebSocket handshake, and image asset to deliver instantaneous tactile feedback.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Leadership & Specialists -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 80px;">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <span class="tag">Leadership</span>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--jakarta); font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink-heading); margin-top: 12px;">
          Architects of the Glow-Up
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;">
        <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--card-gray); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);">
          <img src="/assets/avatars/a96-32.jpg" alt="Alex Mercer" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 16px; object-fit: cover;" />
          <h4 style="font-family: var(--jakarta); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-heading);">Alex Mercer</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 12px;">Lead Systems Architect</p>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--gray);">Former Distributed Systems Lead at scale. Specializes in LangGraph orchestration, semantic caching, and latency optimization.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--card-gray); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);">
          <img src="/assets/avatars/a96-47.jpg" alt="Elena Rostova" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 16px; object-fit: cover;" />
          <h4 style="font-family: var(--jakarta); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-heading);">Elena Rostova</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 12px;">Principal AI Engineer</p>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--gray);">Expert in multimodal vision-language models, automated OCR pipelines, and strict Pydantic evaluation benchmarks.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--card-gray); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);">
          <img src="/assets/avatars/a96-12.jpg" alt="Marcus Vance" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 16px; object-fit: cover;" />
          <h4 style="font-family: var(--jakarta); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-heading);">Marcus Vance</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 12px;">Creative Director</p>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--gray);">Obsessive typography, motion design, and mobile ergonomics specialist. Crafted award-winning App Store featured layouts.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--card-gray); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);">
          <img src="/assets/avatars/a96-59.jpg" alt="Rehan Ahmed" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 16px; object-fit: cover;" />
          <h4 style="font-family: var(--jakarta); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-heading);">Rehan Ahmed</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 12px;">Head of Product Design</p>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--gray);">Pioneer in Claude-assisted interface prototyping and design systems. Turned 50+ messy apps into investor-ready assets.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Call to action block -->
    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1f1f32 0%, #262ef2 100%); border-radius: 24px; padding: 48px; color: #ffffff; text-align: center;">
      <h3 style="font-family: var(--jakarta); font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 14px;">Let us review your app screens live.</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 16px; opacity: 0.88; max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto 28px;">Send over your messy sketches, legacy portals, or prompt chains. We will walk through exact modernization opportunities.</p>
      <a class="submit-btn-primary" href="/contact-us" style="background: #ffffff; color: var(--blue); max-width: 240px; margin: 0 auto; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">
        Book a 20-Min Call
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
